        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 33,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "there's a magic in personalization",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F6BFFB32C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 84,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "when they see themselves in the story",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B82654686B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "For example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E86374F9D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "(Laughter) I was responsible for putting your face on a dancing elf during the holidays.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "554DCCCBB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "I am also very proud to have given you your own personal stalker with \"Take This Lollipop.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "459B72DC6F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "given you your own",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "150EE5EDAB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "No applause for that one?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7CE6BCFE67",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "Come on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC611A2542",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "(Laughter) And I also transported people all over the world to Melbourne, Australia, where I let you control tourists.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DFBCFE3FA2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 27,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "I put you into a Zoom-like interactive horror film",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF200DE191",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "But I created something recently that wasn't interactive, it wasn't personalized.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "031A20741C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "It was a short film.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EC0D703CA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "It was set in gritty 1970s New York City, and this blaxploitation film featured a kung fu warrior out for revenge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "770453F2AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 146,
        "text": "And it featured big set pieces, loads of special effects, and it also featured one of the most iconic hip hop bands of all time, the Wu-Tang Clan.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2963BD3B0C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 204,
        "text": "Now traditionally, this would have cost millions of dollars to produce and taken months and months of time, but it was created by just a few people in under three weeks, all from the comforts of our home.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EE08ACC253",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "Now I began as a traditional filmmaker, and I realized that everything that you saw on screen before is a string of text, which is otherwise known as a prompt.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A057136B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 60,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "everything that you saw on screen",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1557829F3A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And when I was on set, I'm constantly prompting all my department heads.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57EF2FBEC4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "it's a string of texts",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22F66EDD49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "I'm taking what's in my brain, and it's a string of texts that ends up basically communicating my vision.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B176290483",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "With generative AI, I'm able to do the same thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FB83FF3CFA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "I take what’s in my head and I put it into a series of prompts.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0709D93CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "This is the lead character, this is Mandingo.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "768EB4C599",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "This is his prompt.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06BE09053A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "That's casting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BEAC1CD757",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Then it comes to virtual wardrobe styling.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1EFBD7C8D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "black leather pants, gold shirt, fur coat",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "88E7AC2DDA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "So black leather pants, gold shirt, fur coat, that created Claudine.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D3444DD32",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "Now I have to remind you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9669BE6202",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Now I have to remind you, this is all text.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "990A4D5CA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "Then, when it comes to location scouting, here is a massive restaurant in Chinatown.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1668A0E935",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "Then we have the Jade nightclub.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13D7AFF87A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "Then we have a dojo on a rooftop.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A76F49CF25",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "All of these create a 4.5-minute music video that felt like a feature film.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "46A4413C66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 121,
        "endOffset": 142,
        "text": "not months, not years",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8A24EA8276",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 143,
        "text": "And one of the most amazing things is, with generative AI technology, we are able to build massive story worlds in days, not months, not years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "124EA6A73E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "So I had this idea.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C1DD83B1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "What if, in a few days from now, I could get everyone in this room to help me create a short film?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9A9B35B805",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "Are you guys down?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EED1CF95EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Cheers and applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97AF915D46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "Sci-fi, thrillers, what else?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18AD05CF2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Who wants to go?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18DE907515",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "(Audience shouting) I heard rom-com.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A2DD654AA6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Sci-fi, western, comedy, anime, horror.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "15DB9430B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "OK, a lot.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "225208A9A0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "What if we did rom-com?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B205931301",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "Anybody for that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F17AEC9E8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
