    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "So how'd it go?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "132BD2034D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "Jason Zada: Well, I haven't slept in a few days.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9CBCA4B123",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 54,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "How do I tell a story about a beaver and a magic sock?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D3E8A0770",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "everything goes back to story.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A01D6347DD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "a good foundation for a story, everything kind of works its way out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DFA51B43A4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "So I think we figured out an interesting story about a beaver, his magic sock, underwater, and how to blend that with sci-fi.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BDDB0C32A0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 64,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "you know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E65D4BF9A9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "HW: No, definitely not.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C99190456E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "88",
        "end": "88",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "JZ: I wouldn't have picked those things in a million years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7A5807BEFE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "you're dealt with those cards",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "236CEC1191",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 71,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "go back to the foundation of what makes a great story",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C34BEEF963",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "90",
        "end": "90",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "I think one of the most important questions that I have to ask you is, does the beaver have a name?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6C78CAC278",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "91",
        "end": "91",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "If I said no, would that be bad?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "860D7C5D56",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "92",
        "end": "92",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "I mean, it's on your conscience.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E395F26D23",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "93",
        "end": "93",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "He did have a name, I forgot it by this point, because we just started calling him Beaver.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8A7E4CD03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "94",
        "end": "94",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "So when you talked about the Wu-Tang Clan piece that you made, that was like, three weeks that you said.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "71D4086BAD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "95",
        "end": "95",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "And we gave you three days, essentially.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F6B26E203",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "96",
        "end": "96",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "So how high should our expectations be?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D7A1D33DF4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "97",
        "end": "97",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "Set them as low as possible because it will only get better from there.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "65E188F211",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "98",
        "end": "98",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "one of the great things is that when you're dealt with",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0BF7D7A73E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "98",
        "end": "98",
        "startOffset": 114,
        "endOffset": 190,
        "text": "you're forced to make decisions, you're forced to live with those decisions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "64A003307C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "99",
        "end": "99",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "And you really just kind of have to live in that moment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C799278521",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "100",
        "end": "100",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "And there's never like, well, you know -- I mean, we did change things, but at the end of the day, you know, when it's done, it's done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E07E2FED77",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
